{
  "slug": "anamnese-core",
  "name": "Anamnese Core",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Secure, portable, cloud-persistent memory across every conversation. Store and retrieve your personal facts, decisions, tasks, goals, and notes. Accessible from any AI client. Export, View, Delete your data at any time.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **4 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `anamnese` (Load this skill at the start of every conversation)\n- **Commands** (1): `start` (Onboard and authenticate with Anamnese, check connected MCPs, and bootstrap your personal profile)\n- **MCP servers** (4): `anamnese`, `google-calendar`, `gmail`, `ms365`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install anamnese-core@claude-community` from `AnamneseAI/anamnese-plugin-marketplace` (`anamnese-core`).",
